@name promote request
@type slash
@parent Request promotions and check things.
@description Ask to be promoted.
$ephemeral
$var[r;$promoRequest]
$if[$var[r]==promoted]
Promoted to **$json[rankName]** in the Roblox group. use /verify for update again in #verification.
$elseif[$var[r]==needs_approval]
$if[$json[posted]==yes]
You are eligible for what **$json[rankName]** asks for, your request is sent, waiting for HC to approve.
$else
You meet everything **$json[rankName]** asks for, but some dumbass deleted the promotion req channel. Ask a staff member to check `PROMOTION_CHANNEL_ID`.
$endif
$elseif[$var[r]==not_ready]
Not yet, work more on **$json[missing]**.
$include[promocard]
$elseif[$var[r]==manual]
**$json[rankName]** needs manual approval.
$elseif[$var[r]==unconfigured]
Requirments for **$json[rankName]** is still WiP, will be updated soon.
$elseif[$var[r]==top]
Wow you found weird thing here
$else
$json[error]
$endif
---
@name promote check
@type slash
@description What the next rank up needs.
@option user:user:Whose progress to check.
$c[Public, so it can be shown to whoever is asking about it.]
$var[r;$promoCheck[$message[user]]]
$if[$var[r]!=ok]
$ephemeral
$stop[$json[error]]
$endif
$include[promocard]
---
@name promote ranks
@type slash
@description Every rank and what it asks for.
$ephemeral
$promoRanks
$if[$json[stored]==0]
$stop[$if[$json[group]==yes;No ranks have been read from the group yet. Run `/promote sync`.;Promotions are off: set `ROBLOX_GROUP_ID` and `ROBLOX_GROUP_COOKIE`, then restart.]]
$endif
$onlyIf[$json[count]>0;The group has no ranks between Guest and the owner, so there is nothing to promote into.]
$addContainer[ranks]
$addTextDisplay[$jsonList[ranks;`{number}` **{name}** ({modeLabel}{memberText})
{requirements|_nothing written yet_};;\n\n]]
$addSeparator
$addTextDisplay[$if[$json[sheets]==yes;Edit these in the **Ranks** tab of the linked sheet.;Google Sheets is not configured, so nothing can be written against them yet.]]
$closeContainer
---
@name promote sync
@type slash
@description Sync with new updates
$ephemeral
$onlyIf[$aesuAllowed[promotion]==yes;$if[$aesuRole[promotion]==;You do not have permission to do that.;Only $aesuRole[promotion] can do that.]]
$var[r;$promoSync]
$onlyIf[$var[r]==ok;$json[error]]
$if[$json[sheets]==yes]
Synced $json[ranks] rank(s) with the sheet.
$if[$json[problemCount]>0]

I could not read $json[problemCount] requirement(s):
$jsonList[problems;• {@}]
$endif
$else
Read $json[ranks] rank(s) from the group. Set `GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` to write requirements against them.
$endif
---
@name promocard
@type snippet
$c[The promotion check, from $promoCheck's JSON: one bar per requirement of the next rank up.]
$addContainer[promotion]
$addSection[### $if[$json[atTop]==yes;Promotions;Promotion to $json[nextName]]
Currently **$json[currentName]**$if[$json[squad]!=; · $json[squad]]$if[$json[robloxUsername]!=; · `$json[robloxUsername]`]
$if[$json[atTop]==yes;This is error message too, but i dont know why so blame malleggc for this.;$if[$json[unconfigured]==yes;so this is error message, blame rammingt for this.;$if[$json[ready]==yes;Run `/promote request` to promote.;**$json[percent]%** of the way there.]]];$userAvatar[$json[discordId]]]
$if[$json[requirementCount]>0]
$addSeparator
$addTextDisplay[$jsonList[requirements;{icon} **{label}**
`{bar}` {amount};;\n\n]]
$endif
$if[$json[hiddenCount]>0]
$addTextDisplay[and $json[hiddenCount] further requirement(s).]
$endif
$if[$json[next;generalCount]>0]
$addSeparator
$addTextDisplay[**General requirements**
$json[next;generalList]
*Required to promote*]
$endif
$addTextDisplay[-# Counted across every shift ever logged$if[$json[hostedEvents]>0; · $json[hostedEvents] event(s) hosted]]
$closeContainer
---
@name promotion request
@type hook
$c[Posted in PROMOTION_CHANNEL_ID for a rank set to approval. Redrawn with decided = yes once staff press a button.]
$if[$json[decided]==no]
$json[staffRole]
$endif
$addContainer[request]
$addTextDisplay[### Promotion to $json[rankName]
<@$json[discordId]> meets everything **$json[rankName]** asks for, and is currently **$json[currentName]**.]
$addSeparator
$addTextDisplay[**Requirements**
$jsonList[requirements;{mark} {description}]]
$if[$json[next;generalCount]>0]
$addTextDisplay[**Check before approving**
$json[next;generalList]]
$endif
$if[$json[decided]==yes]
$addSeparator
$addTextDisplay[**$if[$json[approved]==yes;Approved;Denied]** by <@$json[decidedBy]>
$json[note]]
$else
$addButton[yes;aesu:promote_ok:$json[discordId]:$json[roleId];Approve;success]
$addButton[no;aesu:promote_no:$json[discordId]:$json[roleId];Deny;danger]
$endif
$addTextDisplay[-# Approving sets their rank in the Roblox group. Rover moves their Discord roles.]
$closeContainer
$include[promocard]
---
@name aesu:promote_ok
@type button
$ephemeral
$var[r;$promoDecide[approve;$message[1];$message[2]]]
$onlyIf[$var[r]==ok;$json[error]]
<@$json[discordId]> is now **$json[rankName]**. Their Discord roles follow once Rover catches up.
---
@name aesu:promote_no
@type button
$ephemeral
$var[r;$promoDecide[deny;$message[1];$message[2]]]
$onlyIf[$var[r]==ok;$json[error]]
<@$json[discordId]>'s promotion request was turned down.
